{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"wuzhu-p0062","name":"徐福","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o096"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wuzhu-m-o096-wuzhu-p0062","kind":"allusion","text":"祖系或典故提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o096"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wuzhu-q-o096","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-fc10daa0001199bed780","layer":"original","quote":"遣将军卫温、诸葛直，将甲士万人浮海，求夷洲及亶洲〖4〗。亶洲在海中；长老传言〖5〗，秦始皇帝遣方士徐福，将童男童女数千人入海，求蓬莱神山及仙药〖6〗，止此洲不还。世相承有数万家；其上人民，时有至会稽货布〖7〗。会稽东县人〖8〗，海行，亦有遭风流移至亶洲者。所在绝远，猝不可得至；但得夷洲数千人还。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":503,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":148,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
